# C · BON NUIT :: easy transition loop
bpm 130   swing 63   key ab
filter -.55   reso .5   pump .3   drive .2   glue .3
verb .8   delay .7   dtime 3   dfb .65

bd  x... x... x... x...  lvl=0
st  x... .... .... ....  chord=m11 cut=.3 dec=.9 verb=.8 dly=.6
pc  e(5,13)              fm=.2 ratio=.7 lvl=.3 dly=.7 pan=.35
rs  x..                  lvl=.3 dly=.6 pan=-.35
ch  ...o ...o ...o ...o  lvl=.3 dec=.1
